      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, talk to a doctor etc etc... but i'm pretty healthy and i've always been able to handle way more caffeine than most people. i'm not looking for a long term diet plan, i just need to know the upper limit for these two specifically so i don't go overboard but still get the metabolic effect. like, if i'm looking at milligrams, what's the highest effective dose i can safely aim for in one sitting?",
